the target language is: prolog.

the templates are:
    *a thing* is the p of *a second thing*.

the knowledge base base includes:

the text of the ruleset is at "sources/base.data".

scenario dataset is, as stated in the dataset:
    a is the p of b.
    b is the p of c.
    c is the p of d.
    p expects answers ["a is the p of b", "b is the p of c", "c is the p of d"].

query p is:
    which thing is the p of which second thing.

